<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="BaseHumanMakeableGun">
		<defName>GV_ChargeFoldingCarbine</defName>
		<label>charge folding carbine</label>
		<description>Charge caliber semi-auto rifle with a unique folding mechanism, decent scope, and a versatile shield hook. Renowned among frontier explorers for being able to fit into the smallest spaceport luggage regulatory category, waiving additional storage fees.\n\nThe metal clamp below the barrel, while not as comfortable as a real bipod, allows attaching the rifle to a shield for one-handed operation or mounting on cover for improved stability. Not particularly accurate or destructive compared to military-grade armaments.</description>
